ng class=3D"style_chapter__grtAe">18</strong><h1>Nearby Friends</h1></heade=
r><p>In this chapter, we design a scalable backend system for a new mobile =
app feature called "Nearby Friends''. For an opt-in user who grants permiss=
ion to access their location, the mobile client presents a list of friends =
who are geographically nearby. If you are looking for a real-world example,=
 please refer to this article [1] about a similar feature in the Facebook a=
pp.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a mobile application screen displaying a li=
st of nearby friends.  The top displays the time (10:52), battery level (82=
%), and a settings icon. A back arrow is present to navigate back. The titl=
